      "jcr:created": "Tue Oct 11 2022 15:17:46 GMT+0000",
      "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-2em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">John Brown</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-2em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Chairman Emeritus</span></span></p>\n<p><br>\nMr. Brown became chairman emeritus in January 2010. He previously served as president of Stryker from 1977 to 2003. He was chief executive officer from 1977 to 2004 and director from 1977 to 2009. He was chairman of the board from 1981 to 2009.<br>\n</p>\n",
